[statement]
As `the-world-is-walked-in-name-order-for-decisions`, with `b` reaching
`x` and `c` reaching `y`: `x` is decided first, for `p1`, and `y` then
needs `p2` too.

[repository]
P:p1
V:1.0-r0
p:x
k:100

P:p2
V:1.0-r0
p:x y=1
k:10

P:b
V:1
D:x

P:c
V:1
D:y

[request]
b
c

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p1 1.0-r0
install b 1
install p2 1.0-r0
install c 1
